    {
        "text": "An elaborate black structure lies at the end of the tunnel."
    },
    {
        "text": "Generation after generation, the greatest minds in Victoria came together to build it."
    },
    {
        "text": "All this, just to hold a sword."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "showall",
        "image": "32_g10_kingrestcore",
        "x": 100,
        "y": 0,
        "xScale": 1.3,
        "yScale": 1.3,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "block": true,
        "image": "blocker_movi",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "backgroundtween",
        "xFrom": 100,
        "yFrom": 0,
        "xTo": -100,
        "yTo": 0,
        "xScaleFrom": 1.3,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.3,
        "xScaleTo": 1.3,
        "yScaleTo": 1.3,
        "duration": 20,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "If few are the heroes who can use it to conquer Catastrophe, then let humanity use its wisdom to raise a shield against the storm."
    },
    {
        "text": "These structures, the entire building, was made for this."
    },
    {
        "text": "The voices rise up again."
    },
    {
        "text": "The calls are no longer urgent, no longer sharp, no longer attempting to persuade or incite."
    },
    {
        "text": "She feels a tired sense of peace."
    },
    {
        "text": "She has been here before. She has been guided to this place, long before her memories took shape."
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like then, she knows where she must go, what she must take."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is right there, in the middle of the room, unguarded, so unremarkable it might as well have been a tiny decoration in this grand building."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
