    {
        "text": "Kyngasycath, the Sighs of Kings."
    },
    {
        "text": "It lay there and continues to do so, over the centuries, through countless reforgings."
    },
    {
        "text": "Siege extends a hand towards it."
    },
    {
        "text": "Broken shadows fill the space, rising and ebbing, resonating."
    },
    {
        "text": "Alexandrina. Alexandrina Vina Victoria. They whisper her name."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "32_i10",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She touches the sword."
    },
    {
        "text": "Shards of days gone by pass through her body. She hears a boom in her mind."
    },
    {
        "text": "Suddenly, she understands."
    },
    {
        "text": "She is the source of all those visions and sounds."
    },
    {
        "text": "They are her doubts, confusion, regrets, recollections."
    },
    {
        "text": "Things she has forgotten, and things she intentionally forgot."
    },
    {
        "text": "A great hand raises her. Londinium stands up from beneath her, taking her across the land of Victoria."
    },
    {
        "text": "The land that she and her friends walked."
    },
    {
        "text": "Countless voices superimpose upon one another."
    },
    {
        "text": "Victoria, Victoria."
    },
    {
        "text": "This is Victoria."
    },
    {
        "text": "Her Victoria."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
