        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Siege opens her eyes. There are no illusions now, no tides. She holds in her hand the Sighs of Kings, symbol of the Victorian monarchy."
    },
    {
        "text": "There is little to show that it is a sword of legend. It is unremarkable in size and design."
    },
    {
        "text": "It looks like an ordinary sword."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have the Sighs of Kings, Vina.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's... lighter than I expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#9$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go. Time to go home.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#8$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "We\u2014",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Siege",
        "end": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.3
    },
    {
        "text": "Siege wants to turn around and feel the sword's warmth with her friends."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_unsheathe",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "But she feels a colder blade in her back."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Allerdale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loneliness_intro",
        "key": "$loneliness_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please! Don't. Don't turn around.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give me the sword.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Highness Alexandrina... I'm sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to do this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Allerdale's voice is calm, but filled with a terrible, resolute sorrow."
    },
    {
        "text": "Siege recalls the 'memoirs' that Morgan wrote in jest."
    },
    {
        "text": "A handful of pages, clumsily written, with less-than-elegant vocabulary."
    },
    {
        "text": "The story starts with a fictional fight. Everyone returns to base after the fight. Allerdale makes a cream stew for them in the story."
    },
    {
        "text": "She laughs in her heart. Allerdale made a stew, yes, but what the memoirs omitted is that..."
    },
    {
        "text": "It did not exactly taste great."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Siege!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_empty",
        "name2": "char_empty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -500,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
