    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_swordexsheath",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "enter": "left",
        "name2": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "enter2": "right",
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You... you too...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to hurt you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I have a debt to pay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our mission is to help Allerdale remove the sword from the Mausoleum of Kings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Finish this job, and I can retire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was an offer I couldn't refuse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We just mourned the heroes who fell victim to betrayal together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought you would understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "text": "But in the end, you're no different from them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm ashamed I thought about trusting you, even for a moment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Like I said, living is hard.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry. I want all of us to keep on living. I'll try to make sure we do just that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#11$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We've both been pushed out of death's way by our friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, our paths happen to diverge this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
