        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I carry nothing on my shoulders. I'll just be your brain trust.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry... I forgot you had Morgan.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll just be a thug then.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Allerdale",
        "end": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll bomb the Sarkaz camp together. You light a fire, and I'll kick their commander's arse once there's smoke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm joking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "My path is long determined, Vina.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why do you say that? You're still with us. The Glasgow Gang has more stories to write.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The answer is yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll make sure you come back unharmed after kicking that commander's arse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's my promise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
